---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const path = '/privacy';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Daily Tarot handles your data: cookies, analytics, and advertising."
  path={path}
  availableLocales={['en'] as Array<'en' | 'es' | 'fr'>}
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: January 2026.</em></p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>
      We collect a minimum amount of data to make this site work and to keep it free.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>An anonymous, signed cookie</strong> — used to enforce the daily two-rejection limit. The cookie contains a random ID with an HMAC signature; it does not contain personal information.</li>
      <li><strong>Local storage</strong> — your reading and any saved preferences (theme, consent) are stored only in your browser.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>AI-generated interpretations</h2>
    <p>
      When you request an AI interpretation, our server sends a prompt to <a href="https://openrouter.ai" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenRouter</a>,
      which routes it to the underlying model provider (currently NVIDIA Nemotron). The prompt contains only
      the nine card names and positions for your draw — no personal information from you. The response is
      returned to your browser and is not stored on our servers.
    </p>
    <p>
      OpenRouter is a sub-processor for this purpose. Their privacy practices apply to the data they receive:
      see <a href="https://openrouter.ai/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer">openrouter.ai/privacy</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Daily Tarot uses a single site-managed API key held on the server for all AI calls. We do not collect
      or store any user-supplied keys, and we do not proxy or forward your personal data to the AI provider.
    </p>

    <h2>Entertainment disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
      Daily Tarot provides <strong>fictional, AI-generated interpretations for entertainment and
      self-reflection only</strong>. It is not psychic, medical, legal, or financial advice, and it should
      not be used as the basis for any real-world decision. Tarot readings are a creative tradition; the
      outputs of this site are generated by a language model and have no empirical basis.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics 4 (anonymized IP) only after you accept cookies. You can reject analytics and the
      site will still work fully.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google AdSense to show ads. AdSense uses cookies to serve relevant ads. You can reject ad
      cookies via the consent banner. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads">Google's advertising policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      Server-side data (the daily-limit counter) is stored in Cloudflare KV keyed by your anonymous ID and
      resets daily. We do not retain personal data beyond this.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can clear your data at any time by clearing cookies and site data in your browser. Contact us via
      the address below to exercise GDPR/CCPA rights.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>privacy@dailytarot.example.com</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
